title Shaman class quests (10-60) (Completionist)
faction Horde
class Shaman
levels 10-60
category Class
zone Durotar
why Every Shaman class quest from level 10 on, in level order. The earlier ones are in the starting zone guides.
reward text What the Shaman quests give, quest by quest: abilities, forms, pets, totems or gear.
